Description: GTK4/Libadwaita screenshot tool for GNOME with delay timer
 SuperShot is a native screenshot tool for GNOME desktops that adds
 configurable delay timers, multiple capture modes (selection, screen,
 window), clipboard integration, shutter sound feedback, visual countdown,
 desktop notifications, and CLI headless mode. Settings are persisted
 via GSettings. Built with GTK4 and Libadwaita for a native Adwaita
 experience.
